#: docs/silkie/developer-guide.rst:140
msgid ""
"For example, a vector drawing application needs kitty's graphics protocol for transmission and "
"placement, Silkie's vector format for its scene, and tablet and ink protocols for pen input and "
"local stroke rendering. The vector specification alone does not define the whole graphics "
"transport."
msgstr "例如，矢量绘图应用需要 kitty 图形协议传输和放置图像，使用 Silkie 矢量格式描述场景，再用数位板和墨迹协议处理笔输入与本地笔迹渲染。矢量规范本身不定义完整的图形传输机制。"

