#: docs/silkie/developer-guide.rst:200
msgid "Capability discovery and cleanup"
msgstr "能力探测与清理"

#: docs/silkie/developer-guide.rst:202
msgid ""
"Query support before enabling an optional mode, apply a timeout when no reply arrives, and keep a"
" fallback for unsupported features. The OSC 777 capability registry covers its selector family; "
"graphics formats, SGR additions, and other protocols have their own discovery rules in their "
"specifications. Disable modes you enabled when exiting or suspending, as the protocol requires. "
"Account for remote connections and multiplexers: the application's effective capabilities depend "
"on the whole path to the terminal."
msgstr ""
"启用可选模式前先查询支持情况；未收到回复时应设置超时，并为不支持的功能保留回退方案。OSC 777 能力注册表覆盖其选择器族；图形格式、SGR "
"扩展和其他协议分别在自身规范中规定探测方法。退出或挂起时，按协议要求关闭自己启用的模式。还需考虑远程连接和多路复用器：应用实际可用的能力取决于通向终端的完整路径。"

